  "responsibility": "Consume one immutable DeclaredContractClosure and produce one immutable qualified binding and composition result, or one typed atomic refusal. Qualify declarations from schema IDs, resolve every declared reference against the exact retained closure and trusted builtins, choose one authoritative owner, and permit only accepted explicit slot adoption. Preserve exact provenance and deterministic diagnostics independent of import and declaration order. Fixed tests must cover closed immutable input and output, atomic refusal, exact qualification and resolution, trusted builtins, positive explicit adoption, the full refusal matrix, collisions, unknown and ambiguous references, deterministic diagnostics, cumulative CC-R01 and CC-R02 regression, and the rule that Quiet Bell's missing import stops before the binder. Own no source or resolver I/O, parser or profile classification, hierarchy, mixin, default, slot, or expression elaboration, neutral facts, EffectiveContract or artifact, protocol, change-set, runtime, or graph, package, version, release, or public API, governance migration, or fixture-specific policy.",
